  "short_description": "<p>Handmade branch-leaf decor from natural rattan by Vietnamese artisans. Sustainable, biodegradable, and available for wholesale orders.</p>",
  "description": "<p data-start=\"229\" data-end=\"255\"><strong data-start=\"229\" data-end=\"253\">Product Description:</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"257\" data-end=\"532\">The <strong data-start=\"261\" data-end=\"297\">branch-leaf decor made of rattan</strong> is a beautifully handcrafted decoration piece inspired by natural foliage. Made from 100% sustainably sourced Vietnamese rattan, each branch and leaf is carefully shaped and woven by skilled artisans from traditional craft villages.</p>\n<p data-start=\"534\" data-end=\"741\">This decor item adds a rustic and tropical charm to any space, perfect for wall displays, shop interiors, or home decoration. It is eco-friendly, fully biodegradable, and customizable for wholesale orders.</p>\n<p data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"762\"><strong data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"760\">Key Features:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"763\" data-end=\"1084\">\n<li data-start=\"763\" data-end=\"813\">\n<p data-start=\"765\" data-end=\"813\"><strong data-start=\"765\" data-end=\"778\">Material:</strong> 100% natural rattan from Vietnam</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"870\">\n<p data-start=\"816\" data-end=\"870\"><strong data-start=\"816\" data-end=\"834\">Craftsmanship:</strong> Handwoven by experienced artisans</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"871\" data-end=\"939\">\n<p data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"939\"><strong data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"884\">Design:</strong> Artistic branch-and-leaf motif with a natural finish</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"940\" data-end=\"1001\">\n<p data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"1001\"><strong data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"959\">Eco-Friendly:</strong> Sustainable and biodegradable materials</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1084\">\n<p data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1084\"><strong data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1022\">Custom Orders:</strong> Size, design, and finish can be tailored for bulk purchases</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1447\"><strong data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1116\">Cultural &amp; Economic Value:</strong><br data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1119\" />By choosing our <strong data-start=\"1135\" data-end=\"1174\">Vietnamese rattan branch-leaf decor</strong>, you are supporting local craft villages, creating income for rural farmers during non-harvest seasons, and preserving cultural heritage in weaving. Vietnam’s handicraft exports contribute significantly to the economy, using nearly 100% domestic raw materials and labor.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1471\"><strong data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1469\">Why Buy from Us:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1472\" data-end=\"1713\">\n<li data-start=\"1472\" data-end=\"1521\">\n<p data-start=\"1474\" data-end=\"1521\">Direct <strong data-start=\"1481\" data-end=\"1508\">manufacturer &amp; exporter</strong> in Vietnam</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1522\" data-end=\"1601\">\n<p data-start=\"1524\" data-end=\"1601\">Over 15 years of experience supplying to Europe, America, and other markets</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1602\" data-end=\"1667\">\n<p data-start=\"1604\" data-end=\"1667\"><strong data-start=\"1604\" data-end=\"1624\">Wholesale orders</strong> starting from one container per shipment</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1668\" data-end=\"1713\">\n<p data-start=\"1670\" data-end=\"1713\">International shipping &amp; secure packaging</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
